{"id":"nocio_n","lemma":"noción","pos":"noun","rank":4877,"glosses":["notion"],"ipa":"/noˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"nociones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-noci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Perdí la noción del tiempo.","en":"I lost track of time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454089","words":[{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"room-temperature"]]},{"text":"Creo que perdí la noción del tiempo.","en":"I guess I lost track of the time.","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"room-temperature"]]},{"text":"Imagino que perdí la noción del tiempo.","en":"I guess I lost track of the time.","words":[{"g":"to imagine","l":"imaginar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"room-temperature"]]},{"text":"Tom perdió la noción del tiempo.","en":"Tom lost track of the time.","words":[null,{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"room-temperature"]]},{"text":"Me distraje y perdí la noción del tiempo.","en":"I got distracted and I lost track of time.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to entertain, distract","l":"distraer"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"room-temperature"]]}]}